{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmfspjiej3VMY21kek6W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SQmE1g5Anj37c5JdpeGCpB","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"answer":"I didn't pick anything. It's endless rows of numbers about shares and dollars, from companies I mostly don't know (מור, אנליסט, מיטב), I couldn't find any bank or anything as safe as a deposit, so I'll ask you or the bank before I open a kupat gemel.","confidence":"fairly sure","gave_up":true,"stuck":[{"where":"Screen 1, row of buttons under \"במה הכסף מושקע\"","why":"\"עוקב מדד s&p 500\", \"עוקב מדדים - גמיש\", \"מניות סחיר\". English letters and shares right at the top, nothing that says deposit or safe. I nearly left."},{"where":"Screen 2, top of the table","why":"The rows start without a company name. I never found out which company the first rows (\"מניות סחיר\" 0.54%) belong to."},{"where":"\"3 שנים 4.33%\" in the returns column","why":"I couldn't tell if that is 4.33% over three years in total or each year. The heading above it is small and grey."},{"where":"Rows that say \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" instead of a number","why":"So is there no return? Is it new? Half the rows look like that and I didn't know what to make of it."},{"where":"The green and yellow rings","why":"I couldn't read them and couldn't tell the two colours apart well. I only read the percentages next to them."}],"used":["Title \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\" and the line under it about management fees","Selected button \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\"","Column \"דמי ניהול ... מהחיסכון\" (0.54% to 0.73%) and \"מההפקדות 0%\"","Company header rows: \"מור 15 מסלולים\", \"אנליסט 9 מסלולים\", \"מיטב 16 מסלולים\"","Track names I partly know: \"אג\"ח סחיר\", \"כספי (שקלי)\", \"כללי\"","Returns column, e.g. \"26.39%\", \"4.33%\""],"skimmed":["The tabs \"לפי חברה / לפי מוצר\"","The yellow box \"נתוני הרשות לא עודכנו מאז ספטמבר 2026\"","Column \"נכסים בסוף ספטמבר 2026\" (billions and millions)","Column \"חשיפה למניות ולמט\"ח\""],"skipped":["Top menu (מדריך, חוקים וכללים, השקעה במדד...)","Search box","\"מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה\" link","Little arrows at the end of each row","Screens 7 to 15, I got tired and stopped"],"unsure_meaning":["s&p 500 / S&P500","עוקב מדד, עוקב מדדים - גמיש","סחיר","מט\"ח with a percentage","כספי (שקלי)","הלכה יהודית","קיימת","\"פחות מ־3 שנים\"","\"3 שנים\" / \"5 שנים\" next to the percentages: total or per year?","123 מקורב / 123 מחושב / 123 הזנתה","green and yellow rings","dotted underlines under numbers","the badge \"חדש\" and \"עוד לא דווח\" with the orange mark","101% מניות"],"not_found":["Any bank name I know","Anything called a deposit or guaranteed, or anything that says it can't lose","A plain sentence saying which track is safe","Which company the first rows belong to","A box where I type my amount and see what I'd get"],"findings":[{"what":"Dark background with grey small text. The column headings and the fee labels are hard to read even enlarged.","where":"Whole page, especially table headings"},{"what":"Opens with shares, s&p and index trackers. Nothing for someone who wants safe saving.","where":"Screen 1, \"במה הכסף מושקע\" buttons"},{"what":"Too many numbers in each row (fee, two exposures, two returns, assets, a ring). It made me anxious.","where":"Table, screens 2-6"},{"what":"The first company's name was missing once the table scrolled, so I didn't know whose tracks I was reading","where":"Screen 2"},{"what":"Big return numbers like 26.39% and 25.86% jump out, but nothing says these can also go down","where":"Returns column"},{"what":"Unclear if returns are per year or total; the explanation is in a small grey heading","where":"\"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת לפני דמי ניהול\""},{"what":"Companies I've never heard of. I wouldn't give them money.","where":"Group rows מור, אנליסט, מיטב"},{"what":"The yellow warning that the data hasn't been updated worried me. Can I trust these numbers?","where":"Screen 1 yellow box"},{"w